#Types of service
cluster ip service - default service, it will give the internal ip to access the service within the cluster only
node port service - it will give the port to access the service from outside the cluster, it will forward the request to cluster ip service
load balancer service - it will create the load balancer in cloud provider to access the service from outside the cluster, it will forward the request to node port service
external name service - it will map the service to external name, it will not create any service
#headless service - it will not create the cluster ip, it will create the endpoint with pod ip, it is used for stateful application like database
cluster ip services
headless services
node port services
load balancer services

